				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									MyoFitness respectfully acknowledge people of the Kulin nations as the Traditional Custodians of this land on which we are privileged to have our clinic stand. We pay our respect to Elders past, present and emerging. We recognize the Stolen Generations and the continuing repercussion of colonisation on Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander peoples. We are sorry for the treatment you have received and continue to experience. We thank you for the opportunity to grow and flourish in your beautiful land. We stand with you.								</div>
